    "type": "question",
    "label": "7",
    "prompt": "On the first day of my holidays, I travelled 85 kilometres from my home in Victor Harbor to Adelaide, then 516 kilometres from Adelaide to Broken Hill. The next day I travelled 298 kilometres from Broken Hill to Mildura.\n\nHow many kilometres did I travel in the first two days of my trip?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$899\\text{ km}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}85+516+298&=85+(516+298)\\\\85+516+298&=85+814\\\\85+516+298&=899\\end{align*}$$\n\nI travelled $899\\text{ km}$ in the first two days.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
